- TF-Hub SavedModel: https://tfhub.dev/google/yamnet/1
- TFLite: https://tfhub.dev/google/lite-model/yamnet/classification/tflite/1
- Class map (labels source):
  https://github.com/tensorflow/models/blob/master/research/audioset/yamnet/yamnet_class_map.csv
  (521 classes; 6 of the original 527 dropped per README fairness note)
- Tutorial: https://www.tensorflow.org/hub/tutorials/yamnet
Labels file: display_name column of the class map, one per line (521 lines).
Consumed by: detection/audio/YamnetClassifier.kt (MODEL_ASSET).
Shipped in: full AND fdroid flavors.
